# 10. Your route factory

I would centralize route payment configuration instead of repeating it.

Conceptually:

```ts
function moltworkPayment(price: string) {
  return {
    accepts: [{
      scheme: "exact",
      price,
      network: ALGORAND_MAINNET_CAIP2,
      payTo: process.env.AVM_ADDRESS!,
      extra: {
        asset: USDC_MAINNET_ASA_ID,
        tag: "x402-global-challenge",
      },
    }],
    mimeType: "application/json",
  };
}
```

That challenge tag matters.

GoPlausible says the tag is what attributes settlements into the `x402-global-challenge` source bucket. Payments without it may still settle and appear elsewhere but fail to contribute to the challenge view. Attribution occurs at settlement time. ([Algorand][15])

