x402 v2 includes automatic discovery so agents can find resources through Bazaar. The Algorand integration supports declaring input/output information and example responses in the discovery extension. ([GitHub][16])

Each Moltwork endpoint needs a very concrete description.

Bad:

```text
Moltwork data
```

Good:

```text
Rank currently open machine-work opportunities by
estimated net value for a worker's capabilities and budget.
```

Bad:

```text
News
```

Good:

```text
Returns machine-readable changes in autonomous-work markets:
new opportunities, reward changes, deadlines, market launches,
and high-confidence demand signals.
```

The competition guide explicitly says the route description is what users and agents see in Bazaar, so describe the actual output. ([Algorand][2])

